{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh67Uy1JaaoCVLP54jqM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For [NiF₆]⁴⁻ I get **Dq = 740 cm⁻¹, B ≈ 953 cm⁻¹ and C ≈ 4.09 × 10³ cm⁻¹**. Each value comes from a different set of bands.\n\n**1. Dq from the first band**\n\nFor octahedral d⁸ the ground term is ³A₂g. The lowest spin-allowed band is ³A₂g → ³T₂g, and its energy is exactly 10Dq:\n\n- 10Dq = 7 400 cm⁻¹\n- **Dq = 740 cm⁻¹**\n\n**2. B from the two ³T₁g bands**\n\nThe two ³T₁g states, from ³F and ³P, mix with each other. Their energies above ³A₂g are:\n\nE(³T₁) = 15Dq + 7.5B ∓ ½·√(225B² − 180·B·Dq + 100Dq²)\n\nAdding the two roots cancels the square root, so the sum gives B directly:\n\n- E(³T₁) + E(³T₁(2)) = 30Dq + 15B\n- 12 660 + 23 840 = 36 500 = 22 200 + 15B\n- **B ≈ 953 cm⁻¹**\n\nAs a check, putting Dq and B back into the formula gives 12 500 and 24 000 cm⁻¹. The observed bands are 12 660 and 23 840 cm⁻¹, so the fit is good to within about 1–2 %.\n\n**3. C from the spin-forbidden ¹E band**\n\nThe ¹Eg state from the t₂g⁶e_g² configuration sits 8B + 2C above ³A₂g, which also comes from t₂g⁶e_g². It mixes with the ¹Eg state from t₂g⁴e_g⁴, which lies about 20Dq higher. The 2×2 matrix for ¹E, with energies measured relative to the Racah A, is:\n\n| | t₂g⁶e_g² | t₂g⁴e_g⁴ |\n|---|---|---|\n| **t₂g⁶e_g²** | 2C | −2√3·B |\n| **t₂g⁴e_g⁴** | −2√3·B | 20Dq + B + 2C |\n\nOn the same scale, ³A₂g is at −8B.\n\nSetting the lower root of this matrix equal to −8B + 15 150 cm⁻¹ gives:\n\n- (2C − λ)(2C − λ + 15 753) = 12B², with λ = 7 523 cm⁻¹\n- 2C − λ ≈ 664 cm⁻¹\n- **C ≈ 4 094 cm⁻¹**, so C/B ≈ 4.3\n\nIf the mixing is ignored, the simpler result is C ≈ 3 760 cm⁻¹. The mixing correction is about 9 %, so I used the mixed value.\n\n{\"Dq\": 740, \"B\": 953, \"C\": 4094, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"10Dq comes from the 3T2 band, B from the sum of the two 3T1 bands, and C from the 1E band including mixing with the second 1E configuration.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1704,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1704,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f76d88c6-238c-4eaf-9d62-0c2713ce0386","uuid":"5d0f3fba-12f1-41b5-8b7c-b53ba26676b2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:21:07.003Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh67UdQM18o1dYqTg6cW"}
